<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;" align="center"><strong><u><span style="font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">About T &amp;P at SSSUTMS</span></u></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">&nbsp;The T&amp;P department at SSSUTMS University plays a crucial role in shaping the careers of its students by providing comprehensive support, fostering industry collaborations, and implementing rigorous training programs to equip them with the necessary skills and confidence to succeed in the competitive job market.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">The Training and Placement Department (T&amp;P) at SSSUTMS University is a dynamic hub dedicated to securing successful career outcomes for students across all disciplines. Renowned for its comprehensive support, the T&amp;P department provides dedicated guidance and resources to empower students to excel in campus placements. the department actively engages with industry leaders, inviting them to the university for recruitment drives. A robust training program, encompassing soft skills, aptitude, and technical expertise, equips students with the confidence and skills necessary to thrive in competitive interview settings. The department offers invaluable career counselling, assisting students in identifying their career paths and areas of specialization. Regular industry interactions, featuring guest lectures from prominent professionals, provide students with valuable insights and industry best practices. Workshops, seminars, industrial visits, and expert lectures are integral components of the university's academic calendar. The T&amp;P department proactively fosters strong industry collaborations, facilitating pre-placement training opportunities for students. Beyond securing placements, the department is committed to the holistic development of students. The university boasts a team of in-house training experts who provide specialized training in aptitude, reasoning, spoken English, group discussions, and technical and HR interview skills. Faculty members from diverse disciplines conduct customized pre-placement training programs tailored to specific company requirements, including written tests and personal interviews. The university implements rigorous pre-placement training programs for students in Engineering &amp; Technology, Management, Pharmacy, Computer Science &amp; IT, Commerce, Arts, Science, Education, Law, and Agriculture, ensuring they are well-prepared for the demands of the professional world. The T&amp;P department at SSSUTMS University has a proven track record of successful placements, with numerous national and multinational companies visiting the campus for recruitment. The department also excels in securing summer/winter internships and vocational training opportunities for students with leading Indian and multinational organizations.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">&nbsp;<br /></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Objectives of Placement Activities</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; "><span style="">1.<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Skill Development:</span></strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';"> Enhance both technical and non-technical competencies to make students industry-ready.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; "><span style="">2.<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Career Readiness:</span></strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';"> Provide students with insights into job roles, responsibilities, and expectations in their respective engineering fields.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; "><span style="">3.<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Industry Connect:</span></strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';"> Build strong relationships with recruiters to ensure robust placement opportunities for students.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; "><span style="">4.<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Holistic Growth:</span></strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';"> Develop communication, teamwork, problem-solving, and leadership skills through focused training programs.</span></p>
<div class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;" align="center"><hr align="center" size="2" width="100%" /></div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Phases of Placement Activities</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">1. Pre-Placement Preparation</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">This phase focuses on building a strong foundation for students to excel in recruitment processes.</span></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Technical Training:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Subject-specific workshops (e.g., coding for CS, circuit analysis for ECE, CAD tools for Mechanical).</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Industry-relevant certifications (e.g., AWS, MATLAB, Six Sigma, etc.).</span></li>
</ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Aptitude and Reasoning Development:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Training on quantitative, logical reasoning, and data interpretation.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Practice tests and mock exams.</span></li>
</ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Soft Skills Enhancement:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Communication skills workshops.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Personality development sessions.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Public speaking and group discussion training.</span></li>
</ul>
</ul>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">2. Industry Engagement Programs</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Seminars and Guest Lectures:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Delivered by industry leaders, covering emerging technologies, trends, and career growth paths.</span></li>
</ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Internship Programs:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Short-term internships with companies in core and allied engineering sectors.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Opportunity to work on live projects and gain hands-on experience.</span></li>
</ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Industrial Visits:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Organized tours to manufacturing plants, IT firms, and R&amp;D centers to understand real-world applications.</span></li>
</ul>
</ul>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">3. Placement Drives</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">On-Campus Recruitment:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Companies visit the campus to conduct tests, group discussions, and interviews.</span></li>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Comprehensive evaluation of technical skills, problem-solving abilities, and interpersonal skills.</span></li>
</ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Pooled Campus Drives:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Joint placement events for students from multiple institutions.</span></li>
</ul>
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Off-Campus Recruitment:</span></strong></li>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm;" type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;  tab-stops: list 72.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Placement assistance for students participating in company-driven off-campus hiring.</span></li>
</ul>
</ul>
<div class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;" align="center"><hr align="center" size="2" width="100%" /></div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Placement Process Flow</span></strong></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; "><span style="">1.<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Student Registration:</span></strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';"> Students enroll for placement activities through the college&rsquo;s placement portal.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt;  tab-stops: list 36.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif'; "><span style="">2.<span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';">Company Orientation:</span></strong><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Times New Roman','serif';"> Recruiters present their company profile, job roles, and selection criteria.</span></p>
